OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny
OL,6,Flingering light rain in southern areas
OL,7,Fsoon clearing this evening, leaving a
OL,8,Fdry night for most with lengthening
OL,9,Fclear periods. Isolated showers may
OL,10,Faffect Cumbria. Turning chilly inland
OL,11,Fas winds become light, staying milder
OL,12,Fand breezier in coastal regions.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FA bright start to the
OL,15,Fweekend with sunny spells, mostly in
OL,16,Fthe south. The odd shower possible
OL,17,Fwith some brisker winds in the north.
OL,18,FTemperatures around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
