OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FWindier
OL,6,Fon Sunday with rain arriving, heavy in
OL,7,Fplaces. Some pleasant spells of warm
OL,8,Fsunshine on Monday with light winds.
OL,9,FStrengthening winds on Tuesday and
OL,10,Funseasonably warm, some rain later.
